ent different kinds of methods, including weighted loss, data augmentation, transfer learning, and U-Net architecture. Weighted loss method achieved 61.07% average IoU and data augmentation method with rotated and cropped images achieved 63.73% IoU. However, it largely increases the training time. Using the transfer learning VGG, we achieve 73.74% average pixel accuracy and 58.45% average IoU on the test set. In addition, we achieve 78.03% average test pixel accuracy and 64.04% average test IoU by the method of U-Net. Finally, we build a new model named Mobile-Deeplabv3+, and we achieved 83.56% average pixel accuracy and 71.35% average IoU on the test set.","topics":[],"score":289658,"global_rank":27598,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":5693},{"name":"FredHutch/nextflow-aws-batch-squared","owner":"FredHutch","html_url":"https://github.com/FredHutch/nextflow-aws-batch-squared","stars":10,"forks":3,"watchers":8,"issues":4,"language":"Python","description":"Run Nextflow on AWS Batch (Squared)","topics":[],"score":289635,"global_rank":27611,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":5694},{"name":"sburden/uk","owner":"sburden","html_url":"https://github.com/sburden/uk","stars":5,"forks":7,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"Unscented Kalman Filter","topics":[],"score":289622,"global_rank":27618,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":5695},{"name":"ZackDowning/NetInventory","owner":"ZackDowning","html_url":"https://github.com/ZackDowning/NetInventory","stars":3,"forks":1,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"Network Inventory of Cisco APs, Phones, Routers, Switches, and other CDP capable servers and devices","topics":["cisco","infrastructure-as-code","inventory-management","network-programming","observability"],"score":289610,"global_rank":27624,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":5696},{"name":"robperc/BananaPeels","owner":"robperc","html_url":"https://github.com/robperc/BananaPeels","stars"